  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380847/description_6338ac4d-ea56-40cc-b177-fad379638363.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Я знаю, что не очень хорошо пишу описания.<br>Но это неофициальный ресурсный пак для <strong>Mizuno's16</strong>.<br>Мне очень нравится пакет Mizuno's 16, но Mizuno больше не обновляется для версии Java.<br>Поэтому я решил сделать его совместимым с версией 1.21+.<br>Я просто скопировал оригинальные детали Mizuno и адаптировал их для нового блока.</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Если вы хотите подключить текстуры, используйте <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> или <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.optifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Все мои дополнения для Mizuno's.<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Неофициальные Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Темный режим Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Связанное стекло Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Анимация еды Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лучшая трава Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Медные инструменты Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты Allay от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Варианты курицы Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Варианты курицы Mizuno's x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты лисы Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты коровы Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты коровы Mizuno's x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты свиньи Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты свиньи Mizuno's x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Farmer's Delight от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Storage Delight от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Crate Delight от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Frights Delight от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Display Delight от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Rustic Delight от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-vegan-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Vegan Delight от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Ube's Delight от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">x Handcrafted от Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-farm-and-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Farm & Charm от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Furniture от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-bakery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Letsdo Bakery от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-reinforced-chest-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>x Reinforced Chest & Barrels от Mizuno's</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Другой проект:</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShorkBee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130037dd8c972d8573f49d7928b542711e2f6ed4.png\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c450b18c2c965d2e2a798f1576231a1f1f37458e_0.webp\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
